# implement-feature.mdc

Goal:
Implement only the currently authorized saved AI task as one Outcome Slice.

Before editing, read `AGENTS.md`, the trigger registry, current-state manifest
and active task. Verify transport authority, DoR, risk, allowlist and correction
count. Do not invent scope, architecture, CRs, live runs or acceptance.

Run the task's proportional gates and return criterion evidence plus exact
changed files and blockers. A self-review is producer input, not task closure.
